---
/** Site-wide footer. The per-page source credit is SourceNote.astro. */
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="inner">
    <p>
      <strong>Usually Late</strong> — historical U.S. flight reliability, built from public
      Department of Transportation records.
    </p>
    <p class="fine">
      Source: U.S. Department of Transportation, Bureau of Transportation Statistics, Airline
      On-Time Performance. Figures describe how flights have behaved in the past; they are not
      predictions and not affiliated with any airline.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .inner {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 22px 16px 32px;
  }
  p { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 70ch; }
  .fine { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; margin: 0; }
</style>
